[10AM] #LagIbdExpWay
#Kara
#TrafficUpdate

Traffic outward Lagos from Kara Uturn has extended back to Secretariat along Lagos Ibadan Express Way, due to inpatience driving,  one way driving habit and faulty containerized truck.
The situation has also affected Motorists on Oba Ogunusi road, with backlog currently at Omole gate.

Our officials are well positioned for traffic management by creating some corridors.
